   "role": 5,
   "cue": "Plead",
   "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
   "text": "[shaking] Let me see to my men. Please.",
   "stance": 1,
   "mood": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r6-greet-s2-m0-0",
   "role": 6,
   "cue": "Greet",
   "voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
   "text": "[restless] Who is that? Oh. You again.",
   "stance": 2,
   "mood": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r6-warn-s2-m0-0",
   "role": 6,
   "cue": "Warn",
   "voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
   "text": "[restless, sharp] Gun down! Gun down!",
   "stance": 2,
   "mood": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r6-betrayed-s0-m0-0",
   "role": 6,
   "cue": "Betrayed",
   "voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
   "text": "[shouting] Liar! Light him up!",
   "stance": 0,
   "mood": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r6-plead-s1-m3-0",
   "role": 6,
   "cue": "Plead",
   "voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
   "text": "[sobbing, frantic] I do not want to die out here!",
   "stance": 1,
   "mood": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r9-greet-s2-m0-0",
   "role": 9,
   "cue": "Greet",
   "voice_id": "2OcnG4mH3jIMtWz3vKus",
   "text": "[smirking] The toll is still waiting, my friend.",
   "stance": 2,
   "mood": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r9-greet-s3-m0-0",
   "role": 9,
   "cue": "Greet",
   "voice_id": "2OcnG4mH3jIMtWz3vKus",
   "text": "[friendly, laughing] Hey! Our supplier!",
   "stance": 3,
   "mood": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r9-warn-s2-m0-0",
   "role": 9,
   "cue": "Warn",
   "voice_id": "2OcnG4mH3jIMtWz3vKus",
   "text": "[threatening, low] Point that somewhere else.",
   "stance": 2,
   "mood": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r9-betrayed-s0-m0-0",
   "role": 9,
   "cue": "Betrayed",
   "voice_id": "2OcnG4mH3jIMtWz3vKus",
   "text": "[yelling] Cheat! Get him, boys!",
   "stance": 0,
   "mood": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r9-plead-s1-m3-0",
   "role": 9,
   "cue": "Plead",
   "voice_id": "2OcnG4mH3jIMtWz3vKus",
   "text": "[panicked] Take everything! Just take it, it is yours!",
   "stance": 1,
   "mood": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "zone-r8-plead-s1-m3-0",
   "role": 8,
   "cue": "Plead",
   "voice_id": "pNInz6obpgDQGcFmaJgB",
   "text": "[panicked, shouting] Fall back! We cannot hold this!",
   "stance": 1,
   "mood": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-elder_hello",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
   "text": "[slow, gravelly] Another one through the wire. [sighs] Sit, warm your hands. You came for work, or for answers?",
   "line": "elder_hello"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-elder_work",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
   "text": "[low, serious] A courier went north to the old fuel station three days ago, with our relay code. He never came back. Bring me his PDA.",
   "line": "elder_work"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-elder_pay",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
   "text": "[dry chuckle] Shells. A bed by the fire. And nobody here shoots you in the back. [pause] Out here, that is a fortune.",
   "line": "elder_pay"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-elder_story",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
   "text": "[quiet, grave] The plant burned, and the sky kept the ash. Then the storms started. When the siren goes, get under a roof. And stay there.",
   "line": "elder_story"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-elder_mine",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
   "text": "[bitter] Cleanup men. Sent in to tidy us away, then forgotten. They're starving at the old mine. They'll talk, if you keep your gun down.",
   "line": "elder_mine"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-elder_pda",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
   "text": "[moved, quiet] Then he got further than most. The code still opens the transmitter on the east ridge. [firm] Tell the world we are still here.",
   "line": "elder_pda"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-cpl_hello",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
   "text": "[tense, clipped] That's close enough. Gun low. Hands where I can see them. [beat] What do you want?",
   "line": "cpl_hello"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-cpl_pass",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
   "text": "[low] Then pass. Stay off the headframe. [uneasy] Something lives in the lift shaft. It eats the lamps first.",
   "line": "cpl_pass"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-cpl_bitter",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
   "text": "[tired, cold] I know what they sent us in for. Eleven of us came. Four are left. [threatening, quiet] Say it again, and you make it five.",
   "line": "cpl_bitter"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-cpl_deal",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
   "text": "[disbelieving laugh] Out? [pause, hopeful] If that tower can reach anyone at all, we walk you there ourselves. Lead the way.",
   "line": "cpl_deal"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-toll_hello",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "2OcnG4mH3jIMtWz3vKus",
   "text": "[cocky] Whoa, whoa. The yard's ours. You want through? You pay the toll.",
   "line": "toll_hello"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-toll_price",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "2OcnG4mH3jIMtWz3vKus",
   "text": "[sly] Something worth more than your boots. The soldiers keep a supply crate by their hut. Bring me that, and we are friends.",
   "line": "toll_price"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-toll_refuse",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "2OcnG4mH3jIMtWz3vKus",
   "text": "[menacing, amused] Then turn around. Or the boys turn you into scrap.",
   "line": "toll_refuse"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-toll_crate",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "2OcnG4mH3jIMtWz3vKus",
   "text": "[delighted whistle] Now that's manners. Go on through. Nobody in this yard touches you.",
   "line": "toll_crate"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-inv_intake_1",
   "role": 11,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
   "text": "[calm, measured] Intake detail. Report.",
   "line": "inv_intake_1"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-rf_intake_lead_1",
   "role": 1,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
   "text": "[tired, uneasy] Intake holding, sir. We heard the great door go.",
   "line": "rf_intake_lead_1"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-inv_intake_2",
   "role": 11,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
   "text": "[cold, unhurried] Then someone opened it. Sweep the booths. Anyone without a band is exposed.",
   "line": "inv_intake_2"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-rf_intake_lead_2",
   "role": 1,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
   "text": "[reluctant, quiet] Copy. Booths. Move.",
   "line": "rf_intake_lead_2"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-inv_intake_3",
   "role": 11,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
   "text": "[quiet, precise] And Intake. If it is one of ours, it is still exposed.",
   "line": "inv_intake_3"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-proc_hello",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "iP95p4xoKVk53GoZ742B",
   "text": "[weak, wary, short of breath] Don't. I'm not going to shoot you. [winces] I can't lift it.",
   "line": "proc_hello"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-proc_who",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "iP95p4xoKVk53GoZ742B",
   "text": "[bitter, quiet] The Investigator. Company man. Came down the service lift at three forty, and every radio's been his since. [pause] He doesn't count us. He counts what we've seen.",
   "line": "proc_who"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-proc_squad",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "iP95p4xoKVk53GoZ742B",
   "text": "[haunted, low] Booth sweep at Medical. He said treat them as exposed. [pause] They were nurses. I stopped following orders about then. [dry, pained] So did my leg.",
   "line": "proc_squad"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-proc_admin",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "iP95p4xoKVk53GoZ742B",
   "text": "[tired] West. The clearance desk's in there. He was in Records an hour ago, reading cards. [uneasy] Looking for somebody.",
   "line": "proc_admin"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-inv_admin_1",
   "role": 12,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
   "text": "[quiet, unhurried, reading] Every card from Energy Diagnostics. Bag them.",
   "line": "inv_admin_1"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-rf_admin_door_1",
   "role": 10,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
   "text": "[flat, tired] Sir.",
   "line": "rf_admin_door_1"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-inv_admin_2",
   "role": 12,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
   "text": "[calm, matter-of-fact] The rest of this floor can burn with the building.",
   "line": "inv_admin_2"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-inv_admin_3",
   "role": 12,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
   "text": "[softly, almost to himself] Not this one. [pause] This one comes with me.",
   "line": "inv_admin_3"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-inv_screen_1",
   "role": 11,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
   "text": "[even, unhurried] Medical detail. The screening floor is closed. Anyone walking it is exposed.",
   "line": "inv_screen_1"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-md_screen_a_1",
   "role": 1,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr",
   "text": "[hollow, tired] Sir, we did the booths. [pause] There's nobody left to walk it.",
   "line": "md_screen_a_1"
  },
  {
   "id": "dlg-inv_screen_2",
   "role": 11,
   "cue": "Talk",
   "voice_id": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
   "text": "[dry, without warmth] Then you will not be busy.",
   "line": "inv_screen_2"
  }
 ]
}